---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact">
  <article class="article">
    <h1>Contact, Corrections & Right of Reply</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        We welcome tips, corrections and responses from anyone named in our
        reporting.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:editor@example.com">editor@example.com</a> <em>(replace with your real address)</em></li>
        <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> Tell us the article and the specific point you believe is wrong, with any supporting document. We respond to genuine correction requests quickly.</li>
        <li><strong>Right of reply:</strong> If you are a subject of a report, send your response and we will publish or link it alongside the article.</li>
        <li><strong>Tips:</strong> Share documents or leads. We protect the identity of sources who ask for confidentiality.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="legal-note">
        Note: This is a starter contact page. Replace the email above with your
        own, and consider adding a simple contact form (for example via Formspree
        or Tally) once the site is live.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
